# Items
# Hot air balloon
orbis_horizon.items.hotair_balloon_crate.name = Hot air balloon crate
orbis_horizon.items.hotair_balloon_crate.description = Deploys a giant hot air balloon. Needs a clear space of 25 x 25 x 40 blocks.
orbis_horizon.items.hotair_balloon_basic_crate.name = Small hot air balloon crate
orbis_horizon.items.hotair_balloon_basic_crate.description = Deploys a small one-person hot air balloon. Needs a clear space of 7 x 14 x 7 blocks.
orbis_horizon.items.hotair_balloon_transport_crate.name = Animal transport balloon crate
orbis_horizon.items.hotair_balloon_transport_crate.description = Deploys a hot air balloon for a pilot and one passenger, with an iron cage hanging under the basket. Needs a clear space of 23 x 41 x 23 blocks.
orbis_horizon.items.cage_lever.name = Cage lever
orbis_horizon.items.cage_lever.description = Lever of the animal transport balloon. Pull it to lower the cage (balloon in the air, side closed), to raise it, or to stop it while it moves.
orbis_horizon.items.cage_gate_lever.name = Cage gate lever
orbis_horizon.items.cage_gate_lever.description = Lever of the animal transport balloon. Pull it to open or close the front side of the cage, when the cage is still and its floor rests on the ground. Closing it captures the passive animals inside.
orbis_horizon.items.hotair_balloon_chain.name = Hot air balloon burner chain
orbis_horizon.items.hotair_balloon_chain.description = Pull it to take off. Pull it again in flight to stop and set the balloon down where it is.
orbis_horizon.items.hotair_balloon_burner.name = Hot air balloon burner
orbis_horizon.items.hotair_balloon_burner.description = Fuel tank of the balloon. Put wood or charcoal in it before taking off. A flame comes out of it while it has fuel. It burns in flight and may leave charcoal in its output.
orbis_horizon.items.hotair_balloon_large_burner.name = Large hot air balloon burner
orbis_horizon.items.hotair_balloon_large_burner.description = Reinforced burner built for the large hot air balloon. It is needed to craft the large balloon crate.
orbis_horizon.items.hotair_balloon_brazier.name = Hot air balloon brazier
orbis_horizon.items.hotair_balloon_brazier.description = Unused since the burner shows the flame itself. Can be deleted.
orbis_horizon.items.airship_cloudwork_crate.name = Cloudwork airship crate
orbis_horizon.items.airship_cloudwork_crate.description = Deploys the Cloudwork airship. Needs a clear space of 11 x 17 x 31 blocks.
orbis_horizon.items.airship_helm.name = Airship helm
orbis_horizon.items.airship_helm.description = The window at the bow. Use it from the pilot spot to take off with the airship, and again in flight to set it down.
orbis_horizon.interactionHints.helmTakeOff = Press [{key}] to take the helm and take off
orbis_horizon.interactionHints.chainTakeOff = Press [{key}] to pull the chain and take off
orbis_horizon.interactionHints.land = Press [{key}] to land
orbis_horizon.items.airship_engine.name = Airship engine
orbis_horizon.items.airship_engine.description = Engine of the airship, under its fuel tank. It glows while the tank above it has fuel.
orbis_horizon.items.airship_fuel_tank.name = Airship fuel tank
orbis_horizon.items.airship_fuel_tank.description = Fuel tank of the airship engine. Put wood or charcoal in it before taking off. The engine only burns fuel while the airship travels, never while it climbs, descends or hovers. It may leave charcoal in the output.
orbis_horizon.items.airship_burner_outlet.name = Airship burner outlet
orbis_horizon.items.airship_burner_outlet.description = Rear burner outlet that pushes the airship forward. Two of them are needed to build an airship.
# Camping tent
orbis_horizon.items.camping_tent_crate.name = Small Tent
orbis_horizon.items.camping_tent_crate.description = Right-click on the ground to pitch a tent with a bed and a campfire. The empty crate stays in your inventory.
orbis_horizon.items.camping_tent_crate_empty.name = Small Tent (empty crate)
orbis_horizon.items.camping_tent_crate_empty.description = Right-click on your tent to pack it back into this crate.
orbis_horizon.items.camping_tent_big_crate.name = Large Tent
orbis_horizon.items.camping_tent_big_crate.description = Right-click on the ground to pitch a large tent with two beds, two chests and a campfire. The empty crate stays in your inventory.
orbis_horizon.items.camping_tent_big_crate_empty.name = Large Tent (empty crate)
orbis_horizon.items.camping_tent_big_crate_empty.description = Right-click on your tent to pack it back into this crate.
orbis_horizon.items.camping_tent_decor_ladder.name = Tent decor ladder
orbis_horizon.items.camping_tent_decor_ladder.description = Decoration for the large tent. It looks like a ladder but cannot be climbed. It is a thin solid panel that can block the way.
orbis_horizon.items.airship_inkwell.name = Airship inkwell
orbis_horizon.items.airship_inkwell.description = Inkwell of the airship cabin. It has no collision, so it never blocks the way.
orbis_horizon.items.airship_chair.name = Airship chair
orbis_horizon.items.airship_chair.description = Chair of the airship cabin. You can sit on it, and it has no collision.
orbis_horizon.items.airship_stool.name = Airship stool
orbis_horizon.items.airship_stool.description = Passenger seat of the airship. You can sit on it, and it has no collision.
# Chat messages sent by the plugin
orbis_horizon.chat.takeoff.chain = Takeoff! Pull the chain again to stop and set the balloon down where it is.
orbis_horizon.chat.takeoff.command = Takeoff! Pull the chain or use /orbishorizon balloon land to land.
orbis_horizon.chat.landed = Landing successful.
orbis_horizon.chat.stopped = Hot air balloon stopped. In the air, the burner keeps burning and, once empty, the balloon comes down on its own. Pull the chain to take off again.
orbis_horizon.chat.landFailedContinue = {error} The flight continues.
orbis_horizon.chat.seated = You are seated in the basket. You will be set down on landing.
orbis_horizon.chat.landedStandUp = The hot air balloon has landed, you can stand up.
orbis_horizon.chat.pilotDied = The pilot died: the hot air balloon is coming down to the ground on its own.
orbis_horizon.chat.pilotLeft = The pilot left the vehicle: the hot air balloon is coming down to the ground on its own.
orbis_horizon.chat.fuel.level = {time} of flight ({items, plural, one {1 fuel item} other {{items} fuel items}})
orbis_horizon.chat.fuel.status = Burner: {fuel}.
orbis_horizon.chat.fuel.low = Low fuel: {fuel}.
orbis_horizon.chat.fuel.critical = Fuel almost gone: {fuel}.
orbis_horizon.chat.fuel.dry = Burner empty: the hot air balloon is coming down to the ground on its own, you are seated.
orbis_horizon.chat.fuel.dryDescentStart = Burner empty: the hot air balloon is coming down to the ground on its own, you are seated. It will land when it touches the ground.
orbis_horizon.chat.fuel.dryLanded = Hot air balloon landed, burner empty. Add fuel to take off again.
orbis_horizon.chat.hover.fuelLow = Low fuel: {time} before the automatic descent. Add fuel to the burner to stay in the air.
orbis_horizon.chat.hover.fuelCritical = Fuel almost gone: {time} before the automatic descent. Add fuel to the burner to stay in the air.
orbis_horizon.chat.error.alreadyPiloting = You are already flying a hot air balloon.
orbis_horizon.chat.error.notPiloting = You are not flying a hot air balloon.
orbis_horizon.chat.error.prefabUnreadable = The hot air balloon prefab cannot be read: {error}
orbis_horizon.chat.error.noPosition = Your position is unknown.
orbis_horizon.chat.error.noBalloon = No placed hot air balloon found around you. Get into the basket.
orbis_horizon.chat.error.noBurner = Burner not found. This hot air balloon may come from an older version of the mod: place a new one with a crate.
orbis_horizon.chat.error.burnerEmpty = The burner is empty. Put fuel (wood, planks, charcoal...) in the burner, the pipe above the chain, then try again.
orbis_horizon.chat.error.balloonFull = This balloon carries {max, plural, one {1 person} other {{max} people}} at most, the pilot included. Have {extra, plural, one {1 player} other {{extra} players}} get off, then try again.
orbis_horizon.chat.error.movement = The player's movement cannot be changed.
orbis_horizon.chat.error.modelMissing = Model {model} not found. The blocks have been put back.
orbis_horizon.chat.error.unknownModel = Unknown model: {model}
orbis_horizon.chat.error.noRoom = Not enough room here to set the hot air balloon down.
orbis_horizon.chat.despawn.none = No hot air balloon within {radius} blocks.
orbis_horizon.chat.despawn.chunks = Part of the hot air balloon is outside the loaded chunks. Move closer.
orbis_horizon.chat.despawn.alreadyLanding = This hot air balloon is already landing.
orbis_horizon.chat.despawn.done = Hot air balloon removed. Its contents dropped to the ground, the crate is in your inventory.
orbis_horizon.chat.despawn.doneInventoryFull = Hot air balloon removed. Its contents and the crate dropped to the ground (inventory full).
orbis_horizon.chat.despawn.removedByAdmin = The hot air balloon was removed by an administrator.
orbis_horizon.chat.lock.balloon.break = This hot air balloon is locked: its blocks can't be removed.
orbis_horizon.chat.lock.balloon.place = This hot air balloon is locked: blocks can't be placed on it or in the basket.
orbis_horizon.chat.lock.tent.break = This tent is locked: its blocks can't be removed.
orbis_horizon.chat.lock.tent.place = This tent is locked: blocks can't be placed on it or inside it.
orbis_horizon.chat.tent.noRoom = Not enough room for the tent.
orbis_horizon.chat.error.heightLimit = The hot air balloon cannot be set down here: part of it would go beyond the height limit of the world.
orbis_horizon.chat.heightLimit.reached = The height limit of the world is reached: the vehicle cannot go any further.
orbis_horizon.chat.deploy.heightLimit = Not enough height here: part of the structure would go beyond the height limit of the world. Nothing was placed.
orbis_horizon.chat.gameMode.left = You left the vehicle because your game mode changed.
orbis_horizon.chat.tent.aimTent = Aim at a pitched tent.
orbis_horizon.chat.tent.notOwner = Only the player who pitched this tent can pack it.
orbis_horizon.chat.tent.approach = Move closer to the tent.
orbis_horizon.chat.tent.packed = Tent packed.
orbis_horizon.chat.tent.packedDropped = Tent packed. Its contents dropped to the ground.
orbis_horizon.chat.tent.wrongCrate = This crate belongs to another tent.
orbis_horizon.chat.cmd.light.invalidRadius = Invalid radius: {value}
orbis_horizon.chat.cmd.light.usage = Usage: /orbishorizon balloon light on|off|radius:N|radius:default|show
orbis_horizon.chat.cmd.light.state = Hot air balloon lights: {state} (applies now to flights in this world, otherwise at the next takeoff).
orbis_horizon.chat.cmd.passengers.usage = Usage: /orbishorizon balloon passengers follow|mount|teleport
orbis_horizon.chat.cmd.render.usage = Usage: {command} dual|single|show
orbis_horizon.chat.cmd.render.state = Vehicle rendering: {mode} (view filter: {filter}). Applies at the next takeoff.
orbis_horizon.chat.cmd.passengers.state = Passenger seating: {mode} (applies at the next takeoff).
orbis_horizon.chat.cmd.seatpose.invalid = {error}
orbis_horizon.chat.cmd.seatpose.show = Passenger seat pose: {pose}.
orbis_horizon.chat.cmd.seatpose.state = Passenger seat pose: {pose} (applies at the next takeoff).
orbis_horizon.chat.cmd.seatheight.state = Seat height: {height} block (applies at the next takeoff).
orbis_horizon.chat.cmd.offset.state = Model offset: {offset}
orbis_horizon.chat.cmd.attach.usage = Usage: /orbishorizon balloon attach on|off
orbis_horizon.chat.cmd.attach.on = Hot air balloon attached to the pilot: yes (applies at the next takeoff).
orbis_horizon.chat.cmd.attach.off = Hot air balloon attached to the pilot: no (applies at the next takeoff).
orbis_horizon.chat.cmd.model.state = Flight model: {model}
orbis_horizon.chat.cmd.spawnmodel.done = Model shown: {model}
# Command descriptions
orbis_horizon.commands.root.desc = Orbis Horizon commands (administrators)
orbis_horizon.commands.balloon.desc = Hot air balloon commands (administrators)
orbis_horizon.commands.balloon.despawn.desc = Removes the nearest hot air balloon: contents dropped, crate given back (administrators)
orbis_horizon.commands.balloon.light.desc = Turns the hot air balloon lights in flight on or off (yellow crystals), diagnostic
orbis_horizon.commands.balloon.light.options = on, off, radius:N, radius:default or show (list separated by +)
orbis_horizon.commands.balloon.passengers.desc = Passenger seating method: follow (default, held by velocity), mount (mounted on the balloon) or teleport (fallback)
orbis_horizon.commands.balloon.passengers.mode = follow, mount or teleport
orbis_horizon.commands.balloon.render.desc = Balloon rendering for multiplayer: dual (pilot entity for the pilot, observer entity for the others) or single
orbis_horizon.commands.airship.render.desc = Airship rendering for multiplayer: dual (pilot entity for the pilot, observer entity for the others) or single
orbis_horizon.commands.render.mode = dual, single or show
orbis_horizon.commands.balloon.seatpose.desc = Passenger seat pose method in flight (next takeoff)
orbis_horizon.commands.balloon.seatpose.options = default, none or a list: states+nomount+controller+anim+slot:Status+id:Sit2 (show to see it)
orbis_horizon.commands.balloon.seatheight.desc = Passenger seat height above the floor (next takeoff)
orbis_horizon.commands.balloon.seatheight.y = Seat height above the floor, in blocks
orbis_horizon.commands.balloon.offset.desc = Shifts the flight model display (prefab frame, in blocks)
orbis_horizon.commands.balloon.offset.x = X offset in blocks
orbis_horizon.commands.balloon.offset.y = Y offset in blocks
orbis_horizon.commands.balloon.offset.z = Z offset in blocks
orbis_horizon.commands.balloon.debug.desc = Shows the positions of the current flight
orbis_horizon.commands.balloon.attach.desc = Attaches the balloon display to the pilot or not (next takeoff)
orbis_horizon.commands.balloon.attach.mode = on or off
orbis_horizon.commands.balloon.model.desc = Chooses the 3D model used in flight
orbis_horizon.commands.balloon.model.id = Model identifier
orbis_horizon.commands.balloon.spawnmodel.desc = Shows a still model in front of you (test)
orbis_horizon.commands.balloon.takeoff.desc = Takes off with the hot air balloon you are standing in
orbis_horizon.commands.balloon.land.desc = Sets the hot air balloon down where it is

# Airship prototype
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.takeoff = The airship is underway. Fly freely, it turns toward the direction you travel. At rest it turns toward where you look. Turning burns fuel like travelling. Use the helm again to stop and set it down.
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.landed = The airship has landed.
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.landing.start = Aligning the airship to land...
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.landing.already = The airship is already landing.
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.landing.noRoom = Not enough room here to land the airship. The flight continues.
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.landing.stuck = The airship cannot reach its landing spot. The flight continues.
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.error.alreadyPiloting = You are already flying an airship.
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.error.notPiloting = You are not flying an airship.
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.error.noAirship = No placed airship found around you. Stand inside it, at the helm.
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.error.prefabUnreadable = The airship prefab cannot be read: {error}
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.error.benchNotEmpty = A workbench aboard still holds items ({block}). Empty it before taking off.
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.error.full = This airship carries {max, plural, one {1 person} other {{max} people}} at most, the pilot included (one per stool). Have {extra, plural, one {1 player} other {{extra} players}} get off, then try again.
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.passenger.seated = You are seated on a stool of the airship. You will be set down on landing.
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.passenger.landed = The airship has landed, you can stand up.
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.passenger.pilotDied = The pilot died: the airship is landing on its own.
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.passenger.pilotLeft = The pilot left the vehicle: the airship is landing on its own.
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.error.modelMissing = Airship model {model} not found. Nothing was changed.
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.despawn.none = No airship within {radius} blocks.
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.despawn.done = Airship removed. Its contents dropped to the ground, the crate is in your inventory.
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.despawn.doneInventoryFull = Airship removed. Its contents and the crate dropped to the ground (inventory full).
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.despawn.removedByAdmin = The airship was removed by an administrator.
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.despawn.alreadyLanding = This airship is already landing.
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.fuel.level = Engine: about {time} of travel ({items, plural, one {1 fuel item} other {{items} fuel items}}). Climbing, descending and hovering burn nothing.
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.fuel.low = Engine fuel is low: about {time} of travel left.
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.fuel.critical = Engine fuel is almost gone: about {time} of travel left.
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.fuel.dry = The engine is out of fuel. You can still climb, descend and land, but the airship can no longer travel.
orbis_horizon.chat.airship.fuel.none = The engine has no fuel. The airship can climb, descend and hover but it cannot travel. Land and fill the engine first.
orbis_horizon.chat.lock.airship.break = This airship is locked: its blocks can't be removed.
orbis_horizon.chat.lock.airship.place = This airship is locked: blocks can't be placed on it or inside it.
